  "meta": {
    "aurum": "WF08-01 Market Monitoring Scheduler. Triggered by an AURUM Module 08 schedule; for every configured symbol x timeframe it checks that the latest candle has closed and settled, skips candles already requested, and publishes one analysis request event per new candle (idempotency key wf08-01:<symbol>:<tf>:<candle open>). Every decision is made by the AURUM backend; this workflow only sequences calls. It reads no broker data, holds no MT5 access and cannot place, approve or execute trades. All URLs are fixed to AURUM so the service token can only ever be sent there."
  }
